# Meta / WhatsApp Cloud API Rule

## Key Libraries (Use these — never create new HTTP clients)
- `MetaCloudAPI` — WhatsApp Cloud API (graph.facebook.com)
- `CheerioDirectAPI` — Cheerio WhatsApp API (same interface as MetaCloudAPI)
- `MetaApiErrorMapper` — Raw Meta errors → user-friendly messages
- `WebhookValidator` — HMAC SHA-256 + challenge (Meta + Cheerio + master)
- `WhatsAppTemplateSendGuard` — Template APPROVED + WABA ownership check
- `WhatsAppTemplatePayload` — Build Meta-shaped template payload
- `WhatsAppTemplateVariables` — Variable extraction and substitution
- `WhatsAppSendWindow` — 24-hour session window check
- `TemplateSyncService` — Sync templates from Meta/Cheerio
- `MetaEmbeddedSignup` — WABA onboarding (FB.login → code exchange → phone register)

## Rules

### Credentials
- Load via `$this->settings->getMetaConfig()` — never hardcode or read `$_ENV` directly.
- Active provider → `$this->settings->getWhatsAppProvider()`. Never assume `meta` or `cheerio`.
- API version default `v25.0` — always from settings, never hardcode.

### Sending Templates
- Always `WhatsAppTemplateSendGuard::resolveApprovedTemplate()` before any template send.
- Build payload via `WhatsAppTemplatePayload` — never hand-build template JSON.
- Variable substitution → `WhatsAppTemplateVariables`. Never do string-replace in controller.
- Check `WhatsAppSendWindow` before free-form messages.

### Error Handling
- Parse Meta errors → `MetaApiErrorMapper::parseDecoded()` + `::humanize()`.
- Never return raw Meta API error JSON to the user (contains internal codes).
- 401/403 → "token invalid/expired, reconnect in Settings." Log internally.
- 429 → return 429 user message. Do not retry immediately.
- Do not add retry loops — `MetaCloudAPI` already has `config->maxRetries`.

### Webhooks
- Read raw body FIRST: `$rawBody = file_get_contents('php://input')` — before CI4 parses input.
- Validate: `WebhookValidator::validateSignature($rawBody, $signatureHeader)` — if mismatch → log + 401.
- Return HTTP 200 within 5 seconds. Offload heavy processing to queue.
- Challenge: `WebhookValidator::verifyChallenge($mode, $token, $challenge)`.

### Templates Sync
- Sync via `TemplateSyncService` — never raw API call in controller.
- Templates need `status = APPROVED` + `waba_id` match before send.

### Logging
- Never log `access_token`, `app_secret`. Log only `phone_number_id`, `waba_id`, `template_name`.
